+    // ---- fishpond patch 42: gang blocks capped at two blockers on big boards ----
+    // On a big board the gang search dominates a block plan: the triple-block search tries every pair of extra blockers
+    // for every attacker, and the AI plans blocks many times per decision, so single decisions passed Forge's 120 s AI
+    // limit (varied_20261012_p35 V05 g0/g1; FORGE_PLAN item 1c). Past -Dfishpond.gangCapPairs attackers x blockers (default
