+    // seat), no attacker gets more than two blockers from the gang passes: no triple blocks, a first-strike gang stops at
+    // two, and reinforcing to kill stops at two. Chump blocks against trample (life in danger) are untouched. Smaller
+    // boards are planned exactly as before. The user's call, 2026-10-13. -Dfishpond.gangCapPairs=0 turns it off.
+    private boolean gangCap = false;
